[VSCode_Shortcuts]
Ctrl + G                    =       navigate to a specific line number within the current file
Ctrl + .			        =		quick fix
Ctrl + /			        =		line comment // (add & remove)
Ctrl + Space                =       used to trigger IntelliSense and code suggestions/auto-completion
Ctrl + Enter			    =		insert a new line below the current line
Ctrl + Shift + Enter	    =		insert a new line above the current line

[Windows_Shortcuts]
Ctrl + Shift + V            =       paste content as plain text, stripping out all original formatting (like bold, italics, colors, fonts)
Windows + V                 =       paste multiple copied items 
Windows + Shift + S		    =		select particular area to capture
